### 1.1 Email Intelligence & Linking
- File: `crm/api/email.py`
  - Expose: `get_inbox`, `thread_context`, `save_draft`, `save_draft_with_provider`, `send`, `link_provider_ids` (already present)
  - Add: `resolve_reference(emails: list[str], in_reply_to: str|None)` → returns `{doctype, name}` per resolver logic (Thread → Contact → Deal (if setting) → Lead → Org domain → optional auto-create Lead)
  - Add: `auto_link_communication(doc, method=None)` to set `reference_doctype/reference_name` on new Communications when missing
- File: `crm/hooks.py`
  - Add to `doc_events`:
    - `"Communication": { "after_insert": "crm.api.email.auto_link_communication" }`
- DocType (Single): `CRM Email Settings`
  - Fields: `prefer_open_deal (Check)`, `auto_create_lead_for_unknown (Check)`, `resolution_priority (Select)`, `domain_matching_enabled (Check)`
- Migration script: `crm/patches/v1_0/rel_2025xx_fix_mislinked_communications.py`
  - Re-resolve last N days Communications; dry-run option; CSV export of changes

### 1.2 Row-Level Permissions & Visibility
