## 3) Data Flow (Text Diagrams)

### 3.1 Email (Outbound/Drafts)
User → AI button (Lead/Contact form) → `crm.api.agent.run(email.draft)` → `crm/api/email.save_draft` → create `Communication (Draft)` with explicit `reference_*` → user approves → `crm.api.agent.run(email.send)` → `crm/api/email.send` (frappe.sendmail) → `Communication.status=Sent` → Human Inbox lists via `get_inbox/thread_context`.

### 3.2 Email (Inbound/Smart Linking)
Mail server → Frappe Email Receiver → `Communication` inserted (no refs) → hook `auto_link_communication` → `resolve_reference` decides best target → set `reference_*` → Human Inbox shows correctly linked threads.

### 3.3 Voice Calls
SPA `/crm/voice` → user triggers outbound (optional) → Vapi/Twilio connects → events POST to `crm/integrations/twilio/api.vapi_webhook` → create/update `CRM Call Log` (+ Note + ToDo) → SPA reflects status; transcripts linked with permissions.

### 3.4 Intelligence
SPA `/crm/ai` → Farfalle `/intel/enrich_lead` → display insights → "Save to CRM" → `FCRM Note` linked to `Lead/Contact/Organization`.

## 4) Settings & Security

- `CRM Email Settings`: controls resolver behavior (deal preference, auto-create lead, domain matching)
- `CRM Voice Settings`: controls unknown-caller behavior, webhook auth
- RBAC: Role Permissions Manager for `CRM Lead` (If Owner), plus optional `User Permission` records for org/team scoping
- API security: no `ignore_permissions=True` on list APIs; verify webhook signatures; CORS allowlist for Farfalle

## 5) Testing & Migration

- Unit tests: resolver (thread inheritance, contact-first, deal preference, lead fallback, domain match, unknown)
- Integration tests: list visibility for Sales User vs Manager; draft→send email; voice webhook creates artifacts
- Migration script: audit mis-linked Communications (last 90 days), dry-run re-link, then apply

## 6) Deployment Steps (Summary)

1) Deploy Farfalle (FastAPI) with `/health` + CORS; set `VITE_FARFALLE_BASE_URL`
2) Push CRM changes; build assets (Frappe Cloud pull + build)
3) Configure `CRM Email Settings` and `CRM Voice Settings`
4) Run migration for Communications re-linking; create test users (Manager + 2 Reps)
5) Smoke test `/crm/ai` and `/crm/voice`; verify email resolver + permissions

## 7) Acceptance Criteria (App-Internal)

- New inbound emails auto-link to correct entity ≥90% under resolver rules
- Sales Users only see owned/assigned Leads by default; Managers see all
- Voice webhooks create Call Log + Note (+ ToDo) reliably; dashboard updates
- AI page analyzes and saves notes; no CSRF or CORS regressions

